# 构建上下文白名单外的文件一律排除（构建上下文 = server/）。
**
# 目的：只有 app/docker_worker.py（及其必要的最小文件）能进入上下文，
# 排除凭据、连接配置、测试产物、缓存、账本、工作簿与无关源码。
#
# 用法：docker build -f server/docker/Dockerfile -t excel-bro-python-sandbox server/

# ---- 凭据与连接配置（绝不进入镜像/上下文）----
.env
.env.*
model-connections.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
credentials*.json
secrets*.json

# ---- 缓存与测试产物 ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.pytest_tmp/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache
tests/
test_*.py
*_test.py

# ---- 账本与运行数据 ----
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.db-journal
data/
outputs/
logs/
*.log
backups/

# ---- 工作簿与数据文件 ----
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.csv
*.tsv
*.ods

# ---- 无关源码（运行时不需要）----
app/llm/
app/formula_tools/
app/excel_window_layout.py
app/folder_*.py
app/intent.py
app/main.py
app/models.py
app/planner.py
app/rule_generator.py
app/safety.py
app/task_ledger.py
app/turn_state.py
app/column_mapping.py
app/langgraph*.py
docker/

# ---- 明确保留（白名单）----
!app/
app/**
!app/docker_worker.py
!docker/
docker/**
!docker/Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
